abstract: >-
  Python code, BioModels SBML inputs, and derived numerical data supporting a
  structural-kinetic, substrate-gain, continuation, and regulatory-bistability analysis of hepatic polyamine metabolism.
  The archive is a reproducibility object only and does not contain the article
  manuscript or supplementary material.
